# An allowlist keeps local data, credentials, legacy deployments and git history out.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements.lock
!scripts/
!scripts/build-client-wheel.py
!deploy/
!deploy/publish/
!deploy/publish/render_config.py
!deploy/publish/nginx.conf.template
!src/
!src/**
!skill/
!skill/minder-publish/
!skill/minder-publish/SKILL.md
!skill/minder-publish/references/
!skill/minder-publish/references/*.md

# Host-side Python builds may leave generated paths inside the source tree.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.DS_Store
